PewterCity_Text_Lass::
	.string "Have you visited PEWTER GYM?\n"
	.string "The LEADER uses rock-type POKéMON.$"

PewterCity_Text_OldMan1_1::
	.string "Ah, you came all the way out here\n"
	.string "from JOHTO?\n"
	.string "That brings back memories.\p"
	.string "When I was young, I went to JOHTO\n"
	.string "to train.\p"
	.string "You remind me so much of what I was\n"
	.string "like as a young man.\p"
	.string "Here. I want you to have this item\n"
	.string "I found in JOHTO.$"

PewterCity_Text_OldMan1_2::
	.string "Going to new, unknown places and\n"
	.string "seeing new people...\p"
	.string "Those are the joys of travel.$"

PewterCity_Text_LittleGirl::
	.string "At night, CLEFAIRY come out to play\n"
	.string "at MT.MOON.\p"
	.string "But not every night.$"

PewterCity_Text_Boy_1::
	.string "You’re a TRAINER, right?\p"
	.string "BROCK’s looking for new\n"
	.string "challengers. Follow me!$"

PewterCity_Text_Boy_2::
	.string "If you have the right stuff,\n"
	.string "go take on BROCK!$"

PewterCity_Text_Scientist_1::
	.string "Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}!$"

PewterCity_Text_Scientist_2::
	.string "I’m glad I caught up to you.\n"
	.string "I’m PROF. OAK’s AIDE.\p"
	.string "I’ve been asked to deliver this,\n"
	.string "so here you go.$"

PewterCity_Text_Scientist_3::
	.string "{PLAYER} received the\n"
	.string "RUNNING SHOES from Mom.     $"

PewterCity_Text_Scientist_4::
	.string "{PLAYER} switched shoes with the\n"
	.string "RUNNING SHOES.$"

PewterCity_Text_Scientist_5::
	.string "Press the B Button to run.\n"
	.string "But only where there’s room to run!$"

PewterCity_Text_Scientist_6::
	.string "Now you are ready for\n"
	.string "any adventure, honey...  $"

PewterCity_Text_Scientist_7::
	.string "Be careful\p"
	.string "POKéMON are your friends. You need\n"
	.string "to work as a team.\p"
	.string "Now, go on!                  \n"
	.string "                                                                 $"

PewterCity_Text_Sign1::
	.string "There’s a notice here...\n"
	.string "PEWTER MUSEUM OF SCIENCE is closed\n"
	.string "for renovations...$"

PewterCity_Text_Sign2::
	.string "There’s a notice here...\n"
	.string "MT.MOON GIFT SHOP NOW OPEN!$"

PewterCity_Text_Sign3::
	.string "PEWTER CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: BROCK\l"
	.string "The Rock Solid POKéMON Trainer!$"

PewterCity_Text_Sign4::
	.string "WELCOME TO PEWTER CITY!$"

PewterCity_Text_Sign5::
	.string "PEWTER CITY\n"
	.string "A Stone Gray City$"
